@* Shown when an editor page is reached without a save loaded - most often by following a
   bookmark or refreshing, since the open save lives in memory and does not survive a reload. *@

<div class="empty-state">
    <h1>No save open</h1>
    <p>Open a character save to start editing.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="">Open a save</a>
</div>
